193
00:06:59,450 --> 00:07:02,059
According to a report released by the

194
00:07:02,059 --> 00:07:03,776
Department of Energy,

195
00:07:03,776 --> 00:07:05,950
they used about four point four percent

196
00:07:05,950 --> 00:07:08,341
of all US electricity in twenty

197
00:07:08,341 --> 00:07:09,189
twenty-three,

198
00:07:09,189 --> 00:07:11,146
and could use between six point seven

199
00:07:11,146 --> 00:07:13,702
