00:07:22,330 --> 00:07:24,588
it rose about zero point one percent

205
00:07:24,588 --> 00:07:25,640
a year.

206
00:07:25,840 --> 00:07:27,662
Between twenty twenty and twenty

207
00:07:27,662 --> 00:07:28,451
twenty-five,

208
00:07:28,451 --> 00:07:30,475
it grew about one point seven percent

209
00:07:30,475 --> 00:07:31,480
a year.

