00:07:40,773 --> 00:07:43,172
of the eastern United States,

215
00:07:43,172 --> 00:07:44,844
including Virginia,

216
00:07:44,844 --> 00:07:47,025
the world's biggest cluster of data

217
00:07:47,025 --> 00:07:48,110
centers.

218
00:07:48,420 --> 00:07:50,022
On July second,

219
00:07:50,022 --> 00:07:51,623
twenty twenty-six,

220
00:07:51,623 --> 00:07:54,338
PJM's demand peaked at one hundred and

221
00:07:54,338 --> 00:07:57,110
sixty-two point six gigawatts.

222
00:07:57,390 --> 00:07:59,726
Every year PJM holds an auction to

223
00:07:59,726 --> 00:08:01,829
