231
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:17,226
The total cost to customers for one

232
00:08:17,226 --> 00:08:19,692
year rose to about fourteen point seven

233
00:08:19,692 --> 00:08:21,278
billion dollars.

234
00:08:21,517 --> 00:08:24,122
PJM itself said one auction left no

235
00:08:24,122 --> 00:08:26,726
doubt that data centers' demand for

236
00:08:26,726 --> 00:08:30,488
electricity continues to far outstrip new

237
00:08:30,488 --> 00:08:31,667
supply.

238
00:08:31,847 --> 00:08:34,081
Its independent market monitor went

239
00:08:34,081 --> 00:08:35,087
further.

240
00:08:35,397 --> 00:08:37,766
It estimates that over the last four

241
00:08:37,766 --> 00:08:38,391
auctions,

242
00:08:38,391 --> 00:08:40,524
about twenty-nine billion dollars,

243
00:08:40,524 --> 00:08:43,109
around forty-six percent of capacity

244
00:08:43,109 --> 00:08:43,733
charges,

245
00:08:43,733 --> 00:08:46,487
was the result of data center load.

246
00:08:46,750 --> 00:08:49,060
Let me draw the squeeze.

247
00:08:49,060 --> 00:08:50,844
Here is the supply of power plants

248
00:08:50,844 --> 00:08:51,617
on the grid,

249
00:08:51,617 --> 00:08:52,910
growing slowly.

250
00:08:52,910 --> 00:08:54,103
Here is demand,

251
00:08:54,103 --> 00:08:57,023
suddenly bending upward as data centers

252
00:08:57,023 --> 00:08:58,110
plug in.

253
00:08:58,190 --> 00:08:59,936
When the two lines get close,

254
00:08:59,936 --> 00:09:01,705
the price of being ready for the

255
00:09:01,705 --> 00:09:02,788
